    "provinceDeepAtlasProfile": {
      "oneLine": "Sylvavéryn is centered at 8.066809, -86.299300 under Theocracy, with 103,614,000 people across 10 settlements.",
      "extremeAtlasDescription": "Sylvavéryn occupies 9,634,777.67 sq mi / 24,953,959.60 sq km of modeled Earth-sized territory, about 4.892301% of Belavadös's surface. It is not merely a province but a continent-scale civic machine: Farming, Partial forest and Beach and grass with water define its broad terrain, while its settlements intensify into Farming, Partial forest, Beach and grass with water and Treetops - treehouses. Population density is 4.152 people/sq km / 10.754 people/sq mi, which lets wilderness, roads, faction-held corridors, and vast uncrowded borders remain huge.",
      "peopleFactionsAndFaith": "The strongest public people-groups are Humans, Near-Humans, and Mixed Heritage, Halfling and Smallfolk, Animalfolk and Mammalian Anthropomorphs, Dwarven and Gnomish Kin, Elf Parent Race and Elf Bloodlines, Amphibious and Aquatic Peoples, and 2 more. Frequently recorded peoples include Human, Halfling — Lightfoot Halfling, Halfling — Stout Halfling, Kender, Kithkin, Harengon, Centaur, Giff, and 4 more. Faction visibility leans toward The Freeblade Veil, with worship and patronage records naming Nebyrr, Ishtanora, Iskareth, Asethyr, Thalunesh, Marduthor, Sigrananna, and 3 more.",
